WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:06.000
Did October 7 change you?

00:07.200 --> 00:08.933
It changed a lot.

00:09.733 --> 00:12.866
It changed a lot. First of all,

00:13.133 --> 00:17.500
we know how much it costs to be alive.

00:19.533 --> 00:20.833
That's the first one.

00:22.966 --> 00:25.700
And then,

00:27.166 --> 00:31.400
it changed the way of thinking how to live here.

00:32.600 --> 00:37.500
I published a book three or four months before

00:37.500 --> 00:42.700
the war and I called it, in Hebrew,

00:42.700 --> 00:44.533
"Chayim al HaGvul", it's a double meaning,

00:44.533 --> 00:48.333
it means "Living on the edge" or "Living on the border",

00:48.700 --> 00:49.833
"Near the border",

00:51.233 --> 00:56.633
and it's optimistic. It's an optimistic a book.

00:58.833 --> 01:01.466
Because we always said that

01:01.600 --> 01:05.233
we are living in 95% of heaven,

01:05.233 --> 01:06.900
and only 5% of hell.

01:07.800 --> 01:10.466
The hell is the times that we have to

01:11.400 --> 01:15.400
leave the house for a few days for a few weeks.

01:18.333 --> 01:24.800
We did it sometimes ago, but not for two years.

01:27.933 --> 01:30.600
We learned how to live out of the house

01:30.600 --> 01:32.433
and we hoped to get (back) in.

01:32.433 --> 01:36.300
And it has changed the way of thinking about our place.

01:39.133 --> 01:46.533
And it changed what we are thinking about our neighbors,

01:47.200 --> 01:51.466
because because before the war,

01:51.766 --> 01:53.166
most of this area,

01:53.166 --> 01:55.700
most of the kibbutzim were very activistic.

01:57.500 --> 01:59.833
For example,

01:59.833 --> 02:06.266
I can tell you that I was one of many people who were

02:09.233 --> 02:13.633
going to the border and taking children to hospitals,

02:13.800 --> 02:16.500
Palestinians and their children.

02:18.566 --> 02:20.200
And did it.

02:20.833 --> 02:23.733
I didn't think that I'm bringing the peace.

02:24.133 --> 02:25.933
I'm not the beauty queen that

02:26.500 --> 02:28.533
"Bringing the peace for all",

02:28.533 --> 02:32.066
"All over the world".  I thought that we are

02:33.000 --> 02:36.466
helping to make a new generation.

02:36.633 --> 02:39.533
And that the new generation will be able to talk.

02:39.633 --> 02:40.866
Not to do peace.

02:41.366 --> 02:43.900
There will be no peace in our generation.

02:44.300 --> 02:47.533
Maybe for the little ones,

02:48.133 --> 02:50.900
they will (have peace), but not in our generation.

02:51.200 --> 02:54.433
We thought that we are making something that

02:54.533 --> 02:57.033
will make them talk with us,

02:57.033 --> 03:02.233
make the children of Gaza talk with my grandson,

03:02.233 --> 03:03.733
or with my child.

03:06.733 --> 03:09.400
And what we saw after October 7th,

03:09.533 --> 03:13.933
that there is no uninvolved people on the other side.

03:14.700 --> 03:16.300
Everyone is involved,

03:16.300 --> 03:21.700
because the one who came here to kill and rape

03:21.833 --> 03:24.266
and stole things from the kibbutz,

03:28.300 --> 03:30.066
he's involved, of course.

03:30.133 --> 03:32.233
But the others?

03:32.233 --> 03:34.300
They were cheering their heroes,

03:34.300 --> 03:39.333
or they took parts of bodies of our children,

03:40.333 --> 03:44.200
or they hide hostages.

03:46.233 --> 03:50.200
At last, they didn't tell

03:50.200 --> 03:53.533
their neighbours "Don't do it!"

03:54.366 --> 03:56.200
It's a little part,

03:56.200 --> 03:58.333
but they are involved.

03:59.933 --> 04:04.000
I told the people who came here after the October 7th,

04:05.566 --> 04:06.933
they told me that

04:08.166 --> 04:10.433
they can not do it because of Hamas,

04:10.433 --> 04:11.733
and so and so.

04:12.733 --> 04:14.500
I told them two things.

04:14.500 --> 04:18.100
First of all, if it's (only) Hamas that did it,

04:18.100 --> 04:21.100
then we are doing good to the world now,

04:21.133 --> 04:23.800
that we are killing the Hamas people.

04:23.800 --> 04:25.000
But...

04:26.633 --> 04:29.600
the people in Gaza, if the...

04:30.300 --> 04:33.933
When I'm not agree with my government,

04:34.933 --> 04:36.266
and I'm not,

04:36.733 --> 04:38.433
I'm going to the street.

04:38.800 --> 04:42.000
I'm telling all the world what I'm thinking about

04:42.000 --> 04:43.333
my government.

04:44.000 --> 04:47.800
They have to do it too. They have to go and talk.

04:49.000 --> 04:52.200
It's a risk, but I'm taking a risk too.

04:53.233 --> 04:55.800
So if they want to live like me,

04:57.100 --> 04:59.200
they have to change their mind.

04:59.933 --> 05:01.133
And...

05:03.133 --> 05:05.200
Even though

05:05.200 --> 05:08.866
I've told you before that there is no uninvolved people,

05:10.500 --> 05:14.033
I'm sure now and I knew it before:

05:14.700 --> 05:18.100
if we want to live good here in Israel,

05:18.100 --> 05:18.933
in Kfar Aza,

05:19.833 --> 05:22.433
they have to live good over there.

05:23.333 --> 05:25.733
We failed. We tried to do it,

05:25.733 --> 05:28.866
but we failed. Someone else has to do it.

05:29.133 --> 05:31.066
The Arabs the Europeans,

05:31.400 --> 05:33.033
the American,

05:33.400 --> 05:36.000
the people with the money. I don't know who.

05:37.200 --> 05:39.633
But they have to create

05:39.766 --> 05:41.200
a new Gaza

05:41.900 --> 05:46.166
that the people in Gaza will have something to lose

05:46.166 --> 05:47.633
if they do it again.

05:47.633 --> 05:50.366
If they will do October 7 again,

05:50.366 --> 05:52.200
they will have something to lose.

05:52.433 --> 05:54.033
They're losing now their homes,

05:54.100 --> 05:56.033
but

05:56.033 --> 05:57.700
they don't care now.

05:58.033 --> 06:02.133
They will care in a few months,

06:02.400 --> 06:04.366
when peace will be here,

06:04.366 --> 06:06.266
the ceasefire will be here.

06:08.133 --> 06:10.933
So if the world wants

06:14.133 --> 06:16.766
to do a good life in this area,

06:16.766 --> 06:18.666
and if they want to do money,

06:18.700 --> 06:21.700
most of the people want to do money...

06:24.300 --> 06:26.700
The area of of Gaza,

06:27.400 --> 06:29.266
the city of Gaza and the others,

06:29.433 --> 06:34.100
it's beautiful places, we can do there a lot of things.

06:34.100 --> 06:34.833
The world can do

06:34.833 --> 06:38.133
a lot of things that bring them a lot of money.

06:40.000 --> 06:42.033
But they have to do it. We failed.

06:42.033 --> 06:43.000
We tried.

06:43.566 --> 06:44.600
I told you

06:44.633 --> 06:47.633
I was going

06:47.633 --> 06:49.966
to the border to take children (to the hospital).

06:49.966 --> 06:52.900
And other people did,

06:54.366 --> 06:59.000
they buy and sell something, to Gaza.

06:59.000 --> 07:05.066
They have great strawberries

07:05.133 --> 07:07.333
in some of the areas of Gaza.

07:09.366 --> 07:13.733
And if the world if the world,

07:13.733 --> 07:19.400
if Humanity so much doesn't want the people in Gaza to be killed,

07:20.133 --> 07:22.666
so do it. You can do it now.

07:24.800 --> 07:28.000
It's the right time and in the right place.
